    "user_posted": "the.baby.mudang",
    "description": "This Lunar New Year felt a lot warmer for me than previous years. There’s a lot of reasons for that. Here’s one…\n\nFrom the moment it struck midnight until now — as I’m beginning to wind down for the night — I’ve been surrounded by people who motivate me to be better\n\nI’ve listened more than I’ve talked. The topics of various conversations and stories throughout the day have made me think more critically about what I’ve done, and how I will do things moving forward\n\nI was a little stressed today with all the Lunar New Years prep and activities, but it was very well worth it. I’m blessed in so many ways. Here’s to another year of growth and learning 💪🏻\n\nImage 1: Shrine of 1,000 Helping Hands on Lunar New Years 구정 \nImage 2: Ancestral Charye 차례 for Lunar New Years",
